DESCRIPTION:Ten Left Feet can’t dance. But we can play great rock music t
 hat makes you move. We deliver a high-energy mix of soft and hard rock hit
 s from the 70s and 80s\, alongside stylish 60s anthems from The Beatles an
 d other legendary rock mongers. Our feet might be clumsy\, but our hands a
 re tight\, and our groove is non-stop. We play the music. You bring the fe
 et.
